abstract: >-
  Independent, reproducible implementation of the workflow described in
  Bouzeraib et al. (IEEE Access, 2025): attack-only WGAN-GP data augmentation
  optimized by a genetic algorithm, combined with horizontal federated learning
  for IoT intrusion detection systems. This is not the authors' original code.
